cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use this software, please cite it as below.'
type: software
title: CATCH
abstract: >-
  Characterizing And Tracking Colloids Holographically: a heatmap detector and
  a convolutional neural network on the radial profile of a hologram, checked
  against the Lorenz-Mie theory, that find colloidal particles in in-line
  holograms and estimate their position, radius and refractive index well
  enough for a fit of the Lorenz-Mie theory to lock on.
authors:
  - family-names: Grier
    given-names: David G.
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4382-5139
    affiliation: New York University
repository-code: https://github.com/laltman2/CATCH
license: MIT
version: "3.0.0"
keywords:
  - holography
  - microscopy
  - Lorenz-Mie
  - colloids
  - machine learning
